sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: Unavailable for Configured connectorId
    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the availability of a Connector to Operative.

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeAvailabilityRequest (operationalStatus = Operative)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: operationalStatus Operative,<br>evse.id = Configured evseId,<br>evse.connectorId = Configured connectorId

    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeAvailabilityResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector
    alt Notification sent as StatusNotificationRequest
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available, evseId = Configured evseId, connectorId = Configured connectorId)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    else Notification sent as NotifyEventRequest
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available", component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        Note right of CS: component.evse.id = Configured evseId<br>component.evse.connectorid = Configured connectorId
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end
